Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:56.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How she was always stealing them from restaurants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:56.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她老是从餐厅偷代糖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:59.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not just restaurants, from our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:59.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不只是餐厅 还有我们家
