Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:01.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}盖勒太太
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:08.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: She looks so small.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:08.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她看起来好小一只
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:10.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
