Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:50.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's present. She's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:50.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她还在，她回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.29,0:05:52.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.29,0:05:52.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了
