Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:56.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝她可能死了〞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're looking into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们还在观察
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:01.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, I'll go see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:01.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我进去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.59,0:06:06.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This almost never happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.59,0:06:06.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这种事几乎不可能发生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:25.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now she's passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:25.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在她走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:35.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:37.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just have to know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:37.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一定得知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:39.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it my hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:39.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我的头发吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:43.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, Chandler, that's exactly what it is. It's your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:43.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错，钱德，就是这样 你的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.55,0:06:45.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you have homosexual hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.55,0:06:45.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，你有同志头发
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:51.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: Hey. MONICA: Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:51.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.64,0:06:53.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: So did she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.64,0:06:53.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那她…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:55.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:55.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:06:59.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:06:59.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是糟透了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:03.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:03.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.49,0:07:05.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.49,0:07:05.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道，感觉好怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:08.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know she's gone, but I just don't feel, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:08.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道她走了 但我就是不觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:11.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe that's because she's not really gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许是因为 她没有真的走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:12.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:12.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，她走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们有检查
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:16.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A lot.
