Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:20.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I mean, maybe no one ever really goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:20.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说，或许人不会真的走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ever since my mom died, every now and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自从我妈死掉后 我偶尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:27.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I get this feeling that she's, like, right here, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:27.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会感觉到她就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:34.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. And Debbie, my best friend from junior high...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:34.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有我国中最好的朋友，黛比…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:37.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...got struck by lightning on a miniature golf course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:37.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她去打迷你高尔夫时 被问电击中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.15,0:07:41.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I always get this strong Debbie vibe...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.15,0:07:41.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用黄色的铅笔时
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.86,0:07:44.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...whenever I use one of those little yellow pencils.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.86,0:07:44.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我总是能感应到黛比
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:50.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I miss her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:50.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好想她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.45,0:07:53.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.45,0:07:53.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，你想要这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:56.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, thanks. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:56.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 噢，谢了 - 不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:58.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just sharpened her this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:58.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今早才把它削尖的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:04.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, I don't believe any of that. I think when you're dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:04.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我完全不相信那一套 你死掉后…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:06.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you're dead. You're gone. You're worm food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是死了，消失了 成了虫的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:12.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So Chandler looks gay, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:12.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德看起来很像同志对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:19.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know who this is, but it's not Debbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:19.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道这是谁 但绝不是黛比
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:29.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought it'd be a closed casket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:29.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为要用密封的棺木
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:32.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that doesn't mean she can't look nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:32.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不代表她不能 看起来体面一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:40.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sweetie, you think you can get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:40.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}孩子，你想你进得去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:42.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't see why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:42.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:02.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: Here's my retainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:02.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的牙齿矫正器在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was just thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直在想…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when my time comes... - Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 轮到我的时候… - 爸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:17.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:17.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When my time comes, I wanna be buried at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}轮到我的时候 我想海葬
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:26.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:26.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.59,0:09:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wanna be buried at sea. It looks like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.59,0:09:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想葬在海里 看起来很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:34.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Define "fun."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:34.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}解释一下〝好玩〞的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on. You'll make a day of it. You'll get a boat, pack a lunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样，那一天你们会很开心的 租艘船，带些午餐…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:43.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then we throw your body in the water. Gee, that does sound fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:43.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后把你的尸体丢到海里 听起来真好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:45.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everyone thinks they know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:45.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都以为很了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everyone says, "Jack Geller, so predictable."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都说杰克盖勒 太好猜了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe after I'm gone, they'll say, "Buried at sea? Huh."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我走后，他们会说 〝海葬？〞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:58.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's probably what they'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:58.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们大概就会这样说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:01.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢这样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:15.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, gorgeous. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:15.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿，美女 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.47,0:10:18.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I'm sorry about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.47,0:10:18.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着，昨天的事 我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:22.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't worry about it. Apparently, other people have made the same mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:22.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别担心，显然其他人 也会犯相同的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:25.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Okay. Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:25.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.57,0:10:31.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, uh, what do you think it is about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.57,0:10:31.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你觉得我是哪里像
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:33.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:33.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.82,0:10:35.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You just have...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.82,0:10:35.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就是有种…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:37.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...a quality. - A quality. Right. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:37.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 特质 - 特质，对，太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:41.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a shame, because you and Lowell would've made a great couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:41.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太可惜，因为你和罗威尔 会是很棒的一对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:47.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lowell? Financial Services Lowell? That's who you saw me with?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:47.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗威尔 金融服务部的罗威尔  你认为我适合跟他在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:49.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? He's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:49.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛 他很可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:53.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's no Brian in Payroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:53.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他比出纳处的布莱恩好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:57.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is Brian?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:57.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}布莱恩是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.64,0:11:01.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I don't know. The point is, if you were gonna set me up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.64,0:11:01.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我不知道 重点是，如果你要撮合我跟某人…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.35,0:11:04.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'd like to think it'd be with somebody like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.35,0:11:04.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会希望是像他那样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:06.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I think Brian's a little out of your league.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:06.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为你配不上布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.07,0:11:15.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me. You don't think I could get a Brian?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.07,0:11:15.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思 你认为 我追不到布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.95,0:11:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I could get a Brian. Believe you me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.95,0:11:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我绝对可以追到布莱恩 相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:25.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm really not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:25.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的不是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:27.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:27.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这一件
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:31.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:31.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:34.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've shown you every dress we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:34.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经给你们看过 所有洋装了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.09,0:11:39.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unless you want her to spend eternity in a lemon-yellow pantsuit...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.09,0:11:39.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非你们想让她穿着 柠檬黄色套装入土…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:41.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...go with the burgundy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:41.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不然就选酒红色
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:45.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whatever we pick, she would've told us it's the wrong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:45.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不管我们选什么 她都不会满意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:47.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right. We'll go with the burgundy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:47.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错，就选酒红色
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:50.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A fine choice. I'm coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:50.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很棒的选择，我要出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:52.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait. We need shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:52.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等，我们还需要鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:59.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:59.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about these?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些如何
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.95,0:12:04.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's really a day shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.95,0:12:04.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那些是日鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.87,0:12:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And where she's going, everyone else will be dressier?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.87,0:12:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她去的地方 别人的打扮会更隆重吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:11.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could we see something in a slimmer heel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:11.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能找鞋跟细一点的鞋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:20.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. I have nothing in an evening shoe in the burgundy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:20.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，我找不到酒红色的晚鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.85,0:12:24.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can show you something in a silver that may work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.85,0:12:24.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过有双银色的鞋或许适合
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:27.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it really should be burgundy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:27.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行，一定要酒红色
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.14,0:12:30.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Unless we go with a different dress. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.14,0:12:30.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 除非我们挑另一件洋装 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:32.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:32.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不、不、不，我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:35.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, I may have something in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:35.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等，后面或许有适合的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.75,0:12:50.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.75,0:12:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:52.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is everything all right, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:52.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没事吧  - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:54.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:57.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just Nana's stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:57.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是奶奶的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.15,0:13:16.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How we doing? You guys ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.15,0:13:16.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家怎么样  都好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:19.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mom called to remind me not to wear my hair up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:19.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈打电话给我 提醒我不要把头发绑起来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.95,0:13:22.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you know my ears were not my best feature?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.95,0:13:22.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道我的耳朵 不是我最漂亮的部位吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:24.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some days it's all I can think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:24.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有时候我会一直耿耿于怀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.66,0:13:28.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. I'm sorry I'm late. I couldn't find my bearings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.66,0:13:28.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉我迟到了 我找不到我的耳圈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.87,0:13:30.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heh. You mean your earrings?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.87,0:13:30.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说耳环吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.33,0:13:32.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.33,0:13:32.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:38.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Are these the shoes? - Yes. Paolo sent them from Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:38.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 就是这双鞋子吗 - 对，巴洛从意大利寄过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:41.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? We, uh, don't have shoes here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:41.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛 我们这里 没有鞋子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:45.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Morning. We ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:45.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早安  准备好出发了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:47.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't we look nice all dressed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:47.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打扮后，我们看起来都很棒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:51.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's stuff like that, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:51.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是这类的评论吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:06.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It was a beautiful service. - It really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:06.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 真的是很棒的仪式 - 的确
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:10.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come here, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:10.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过来，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:14.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:14.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:18.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I think it's time for you to start using night cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:18.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为该是你 开始使用晚霜的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:25.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:25.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:29.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing. Just your overcoat sounds remarkably like Brent Musburger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么，只是你的大衣很吵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Check it out. Giants-Cowboys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看看，《巨人队》对《牛仔队》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're watching football at a funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在葬礼时看美式足球赛？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:40.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's the pregame. I'm gonna watch it at the reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:40.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，这只是赛前分析 待会在宴会上才要看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:44.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're a frightening, frightening man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:44.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这个人真是充满惊奇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:47.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: Oh, no. My new Paolo shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:47.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，不会吧，我的巴洛鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:50.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. I hope they're not ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:50.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}希望鞋没坏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:56.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE: God, what a great day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:56.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，真是美好的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:59.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? Weatherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:59.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛？我是说天气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:02.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:02.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:05.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The air, the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:05.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}空气和树木
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:10.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even though Nana's gone, there's something almost, uh, life...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:10.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然奶奶走了 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:14.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ross, are you okay? - Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:14.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 罗斯，你没事吧 - 罗斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm fine. No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:18.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:18.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.69,0:15:21.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...having my worst fear realized, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.69,0:15:21.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我最大的梦魇终于成真 不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:32.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE: I'm just checking to see if the muscle's in spasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:32.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用担心，我只是看看 你是否肌肉痉挛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.33,0:15:34.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Huh. - What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.33,0:15:34.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 呵  - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:36.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You missed a belt loop. - Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:36.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你少穿了一个皮带孔  - 噢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:41.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, it's in spasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:41.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，有肌肉痉挛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.21,0:15:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here, sweetie. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.21,0:15:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来了，亲爱的，给你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.21,0:15:46.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I took these when I had my golfing accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.21,0:15:46.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有高尔夫球意外时 都会吃这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:47.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:47.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢了，妈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:57.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ANDREA: Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:57.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:15:59.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, I'm Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:15:59.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好，我是安卓亚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.11,0:16:02.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Dorothy's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.11,0:16:02.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是桃乐丝的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.23,0:16:05.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, I'm Chandler, and I have no idea who Dorothy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.23,0:16:05.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好，我是钱德 我不知道桃乐丝是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.78,0:16:10.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE: Hey, look who's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.78,0:16:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，看看是谁起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.16,0:16:12.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. - How do you feel?
