Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.46,0:21:59.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看得出来？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:05.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pretty much. Most of the time. We have a kind of radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:05.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大部分的时候是的 我们有种…雷达
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.43,0:22:09.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you don't think I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.43,0:22:09.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你不认为我有…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.35,0:22:10.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...a quality?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.35,0:22:10.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那种特质
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.23,0:22:15.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Speaking for my people, I'd have to say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.23,0:22:15.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}代表男同志发言 我得说没有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.77,0:22:21.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, your friend Brian from Payroll? He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.77,0:22:21.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了，你的朋友，出纳处的布莱恩？ 他是同志
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:22.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- He is? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:22.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他是  - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:24.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And way out of your league.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:24.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且你绝对配不上他
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.53,0:22:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Out of my league.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.53,0:22:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}配不上他
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.37,0:22:34.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could get a Brian. If I wanted to get a Brian, I could get a Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.37,0:22:34.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以追到布莱恩的 如果我愿意的话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.87,0:22:36.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Brian.
